      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't follow what you mean by that. i'm looking for technical reasons, not metaphors. can you give me actual specs for the temperature and pressure settings? we are currently at 200 degrees celsius for 40 seconds, is that too low for certain polyester blends?",
